msgstr "# Ֆունկցիա: selectCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/selectCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **experimental** customizable-select enhancement for `.<prefix>-simple-select`. Everything is\ngated behind `@supports (appearance: base-select)` (the CSS Customizable Select model — Chrome 135+,\nNOT yet Baseline), so it's pure progressive enhancement: browsers without support keep the plain\n`simpleSelectCss` control; supporting browsers get a styled `::picker(select)` panel and styled\n`option`s (hover/selected) from the `--instui-component-options-item-*` tokens. Shipped as its own\nopt-in `select.css` (like `fonts.css`) rather than folded into `components.css`, precisely because the\nfeature is experimental — you opt in deliberately."
msgstr "`.&lt;prefix&gt;-simple-select`-ի համար **փորձնական** հարմարվող ընտրել բարձրացում: Ամեն ինչ թաքցված է `@supports (appearance: base-select)`-ի հետևից (CSS Customizable Select մոդել — Chrome 135+, դեռ Baseline չէ), այնպես որ այն զուտ պրոգրեսիվ բարձրացում է՝ բրաուզերներ առանց աջակցության պահում են պարզ `simpleSelectCss` կառավարում; աջակցող բրաուզերներ ստանում են ստեղծված `::picker(select)` վահանակ և ստեղծված `option`s (hover/selected) `--instui-component-options-item-*` թոքենից: Հերթեկցված որպես իր սեփական ընտրովի `select.css` (ինչպես `fonts.css`) այլ ծալվածքի մեջ չ `components.css`, հատկապես որ հատկությունն է փորձնական — դուք ընտրում եք մտածված կերպով:"

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# components"
msgstr ""

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/components` — an InstUI-look CSS component library, built from the `--instui-*` tokens."
msgstr ""

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The shipped stylesheets:"
msgstr ""

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- **Base** ([baseCss](functions/baseCss.md)) — opt-in global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\n  reset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`). It also carries the focus-outline\n  ring, so every focusable gets an accessible `:focus-visible` outline out of the box. Load it when\n  pantoken owns the page.\n- **Prose** ([proseCss](functions/proseCss.md)) — styles rendered markdown/prose HTML (tables, headings, links,\n  lists, code) scoped to a content root, so a docs page or content region looks like InstUI\n  without swapping the DOM for components. This is what the site renderers ship as their\n  `components.css`.\n- **Components** ([buttonCss](variables/buttonCss.md), [alertCss](variables/alertCss.md), [badgeCss](variables/badgeCss.md), aggregated by\n  [componentsCss](functions/componentsCss.md)) — class-based component styles you apply to your own markup\n  (`<button class=\"instui-button\">`), for the InstUI look outside a component framework. The\n  `--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale ([elevationCss](functions/elevationCss.md)) leads this sheet, since enough\n  components float that shadows are an intrinsic design attribute rather than an add-on.\n- **Utilities** ([viewCss](variables/viewCss.md), [spacingUtilitiesCss](variables/spacingUtilitiesCss.md), [gapCss](variables/gapCss.md), [layoutUtilitiesCss](variables/layoutUtilitiesCss.md), plus a\n  curated semantic-colour/token set) — an opt-in layer of cross-cutting classes. The generic\n  token→class emitters (`colorUtilitiesCss`, `tokenUtilitiesCss`) live in `@pantoken/utils`; this\n  package feeds them the curated *semantic* names, while `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` feeds the raw\n  palette.\n- **Fonts** (opt-in `fonts.css`) — the `@font-face` rules for the Instructure brand fonts. Base\n  *applies* the font; `fonts.css` *loads* the woff2s, so text degrades gracefully without it."
msgstr ""

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Everything is pure CSS derived from the token IR, so it tracks InstUI through the tokens with no\ndependency on the InstUI React packages. For the real, interactive components, use\n`@pantoken/react-markdown` (content) or `@instructure/ui-*` (apps)."
msgstr ""

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This module is a barrel: each documented record lives in its own file under\n`components/`/`utilities/`/`rules/`/`declarations/`, authored with the `lib/` compose API. The\nregistries (`COMPONENTS`/`UTILITIES`/`RULES`/`DECLARATIONS`) drive aggregation + the parity test."
msgstr ""

